{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>PALPUS X ANNIHILATION\u00a0</u></strong><strong>is an OLDSCHOOL ISOMETRIC ACTION SHOOTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thousands of alien monsters are waiting to be splattered. Use every tool at your disposal and get the job done!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/steampage_gif1.gif?t=1743717389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/blood_line1.png?t=1743717389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight <strong>hundreds of aliens</strong> with different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>Campaign</strong> and <strong>Horde Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blood, bodies, bullet casings.. all <strong>decals stay forever!</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect over a dozen weapons like <strong>Shotguns, Chainguns and Plasmarifles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic light</strong> system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different locations and find <strong>secret areas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>explosives and turrets</strong> to your advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill up</strong> your characters abilities: Health, Strength, Accuracy and Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave nothing but a bloody mess behind!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/blood_line1.png?t=1743717389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img cla